# 4WD Vision Line Follower: Avionics & Power Schematic

### 1. Power Distribution Architecture
* **Primary Battery:** 2S 18650 Li-ion Configuration ($7.4\text{V}$ Nominal, $8.4\text{V}$ Peak) or Single Cell with XL6009 Boost Converter.
* **Charging & Protection Module:** Dual TP4056 Type-C modules with integrated DW01A over-discharge protection ($2.5\text{V}$ cutoff) and $1\text{A}$ linear CC/CV charge management.
* **Motor Rail ($V_{mot}$):** $7.4\text{V}\text{--}8.4\text{V}$ unregulated rail feeding the L298N Dual H-Bridge power stage.
* **Logic Rail ($V_{cc}$):** Regulated $5.0\text{V}$ output from L298N onboard linear regulator (or dedicated buck converter) feeding the 38-pin ESP32 NodeMCU development board.

